+| Name | Type | Description |
+| -------------------------------------- | ------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
+| type<mark style="color:red;">\*</mark> | String | "meta" |
+| dex | String | Perp dex name. Defaults to the empty string which represents the first perp dex. |
